lass=\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-accent/60\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-accent/60\" href=\"/about\">About</a></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\"><button id=\"theme-toggle-btn\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark mode\" class=\"relative p-2 rounded-lg text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-accent transition-colors overflow-hidden\"><div style=\"opacity:1;transform:none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sun h-5 w-5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41\"></path><path d=\"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41\"></path></svg></div></button><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 ml-1\"><a id=\"navbar-login-btn\" class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[0.85rem] font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"/login\">Sign in</a><a id=\"navbar-signup-btn\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-[0.85rem] font-semibold gradient-brand text-white shadow-brand/30 shadow-sm hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\" href=\"/signup\">Get started</a></div></div></header><section class=\"relative pt-[var(--navbar-height)] overflow-hidden\" style=\"background:hsl(var(--background));background-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 60% -10%, hsl(196 88% 80% / 0.18) 0%, transparent 70%),\n            radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at -5% 70%, hsl(196 70% 80% / 0.12) 0%, transparent 60%)\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(hsl(var(--border)) 1px, transparent 1px),\n              linear-gradient(90deg, hsl(var(--border)) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:80px 80px;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 90% 70% at 50% 0%, black 20%, transparent 100%)\"></div><div class=\"relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 text-center\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(80px, 10vw, 120px);padding-bottom:clamp(60px, 8vw, 96px)\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><span class=\"flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full gradient-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground\">Platform Features</span></div><h1 class=\"font-bold tracking-tight\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\">Six clinical AI modules.<!-- --> <br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/><span class=\"font-serif font-normal italic\" style=\"color:hsl(var(--primary))\">One unified platform.</span></h1><p class=\"text-muted-foreground mt-5 max-w-xl mx-auto\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.9rem, 1.5vw, 1.05rem);line-height:1.75;opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\">Each module is powered by a production-grade model trained on peer-reviewed clinical datasets — delivering specialist-quality analysis with full explainability.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 mt-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\"><a id=\"features-hero-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:opacity-90\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(196 88% 44%), hsl(196 92% 34%));box-shadow:0 4px 20px hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.3)\" href=\"/signup\">Start for free<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-all hover:bg-accent\" href=\"/pricing\">View pricing</a></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full px-6 md:px-10 py-20\"><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div id=\"feature-xray\" class=\"group relative rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:rgba(8,159,189,0.06);border-color:rgba(8,159,189,0.15);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-0\"><div class=\"p-7 md:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(8,159,189,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(8,159,189,0.15)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radiation h-5 w-5\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%)\"><path d=\"M12 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 4.2c-.3-.5-.9-.7-1.3-.4C3.9 5.5 2.3 8.1 2 11c-.1.5.4 1 1 1h5c0-1.5.8-2.8 2-3.4-1.1-1.9-2-3.5-2.5-4.4z\"></path><path d=\"M21 12c.6 0 1-.4 1-1-.3-2.9-1.8-5.5-4.1-7.1-.4-.3-1.1-.2-1.3.3-.6.9-1.5 2.5-2.6 4.3 1.2.7 2 2 2 3.5h5z\"></path><path d=\"M7.5 19.8c-.3.5-.1 1.1.4 1.3 2.6 1.2 5.6 1.2 8.2 0 .5-.2.7-.8.4-1.3-.5-.9-1.4-2.5-2.5-4.3-1.2.7-2.8.7-4 0-1.1 1.8-2 3.4-2.5 4.3z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%);background:rgba(8,159,189,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(8,159,189,0.15)\">Imaging AI</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">Chest X-Ray Analysis</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium mb-3\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%)\">17 diseases. One image. Under 3 seconds.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">Our EfficientNet-B4 ensemble, trained on the NIH ChestX-ray14 dataset (112,000+ images), screens for 17 thoracic conditions including pneumonia, cardiomegaly, pleural effusion, and pneumothorax. Grad-CAM saliency maps show exactly which regions drove the prediction.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>EfficientNet-B4 + DenseNet121 ensemble</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>NIH ChestX-ray14 (112k+ images)</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Grad-CAM region heatmaps</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(196,88%,42%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Per-disease confidence scores</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l p-6 md:p-9\" style=\"border-color:rgba(8,159,189,0.15)\"><a id=\"feature-xray-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap group-hover:shadow-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196,88%,42%);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px hsl(196,88%,42%)33\" href=\"/xray\">Try module<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div id=\"feature-ecg\" class=\"group relative rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:rgba(239,68,68,0.06);border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.15);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-0\"><div class=\"p-7 md:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(239,68,68,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-5 w-5\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%)\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%);background:rgba(239,68,68,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\">Signal AI</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">ECG Rhythm Analysis</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium mb-3\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%)\">Arrhythmia detection. Signal-level intelligence.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">A hybrid CNN-LSTM trained on MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database classifies 5 rhythm classes from 1D ECG signals. The pipeline handles raw CSV uploads, applies a Butterworth bandpass filter, and segments individual beats before inference.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>CNN-LSTM hybrid architecture</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>MIT-BIH Arrhythmia Database</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>1D signal preprocessing pipeline</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(350,82%,58%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>5-class rhythm classification</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l p-6 md:p-9\" style=\"border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\"><a id=\"feature-ecg-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap group-hover:shadow-md\" style=\"background:hsl(350,82%,58%);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px hsl(350,82%,58%)33\" href=\"/ecg\">Try module<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div id=\"feature-skin\" class=\"group relative rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:rgba(249,115,22,0.06);border-color:rgba(249,115,22,0.15);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-0\"><div class=\"p-7 md:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(249,115,22,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.15)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scan h-5 w-5\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%)\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%);background:rgba(249,115,22,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.15)\">Dermatology AI</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">Skin Lesion Screening</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium mb-3\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%)\">7 lesion classes. Dermatoscopy-grade analysis.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">EfficientNet-B3 fine-tuned on HAM10000 (10,000 dermatoscopy images) classifies seven lesion types including melanoma, basal cell carcinoma, and benign keratosis. Grad-CAM visualization highlights the diagnostic region within the uploaded image.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>EfficientNet-B3 + TTA inference</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>HAM10000 dermatoscopy dataset</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>7 lesion type classification</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(28,88%,56%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Interactive Grad-CAM overlay</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l p-6 md:p-9\" style=\"border-color:rgba(249,115,22,0.15)\"><a id=\"feature-skin-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap group-hover:shadow-md\" style=\"background:hsl(28,88%,56%);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px hsl(28,88%,56%)33\" href=\"/skin\">Try module<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div id=\"feature-diabetes\" class=\"group relative rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:rgba(139,92,246,0.06);border-color:rgba(139,92,246,0.15);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-0\"><div class=\"p-7 md:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(139,92,246,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-5 w-5\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%)\"><path d=\"M10 2v7.527a2 2 0 0 1-.211.896L4.72 20.55a1 1 0 0 0 .9 1.45h12.76a1 1 0 0 0 .9-1.45l-5.069-10.127A2 2 0 0 1 14 9.527V2\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path><path d=\"M7 16h10\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%);background:rgba(139,92,246,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\">Clinical ML</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">Diabetes Risk Prediction</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium mb-3\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%)\">6 biomarkers. Calibrated risk score. SHAP explained.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">A calibrated XGBoost model trained on PIMA Indians Diabetes Dataset takes six clinical inputs (glucose, BMI, insulin, age, blood pressure, pregnancies) and returns a probability-calibrated risk score with SHAP feature importance charts for full explainability.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Calibrated XGBoost classifier</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>SHAP feature importance</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>6 clinical biomarker inputs</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(262,72%,60%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Risk band categorisation</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l p-6 md:p-9\" style=\"border-color:rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\"><a id=\"feature-diabetes-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap group-hover:shadow-md\" style=\"background:hsl(262,72%,60%);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px hsl(262,72%,60%)33\" href=\"/diabetes\">Try module<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div id=\"feature-prescription\" class=\"group relative rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:rgba(16,185,129,0.06);border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.15);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-0\"><div class=\"p-7 md:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(16,185,129,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-5 w-5\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%)\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%);background:rgba(16,185,129,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\">Document AI</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">Prescription OCR</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium mb-3\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%)\">Handwritten Rx. Structured in seconds.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">A Vision + NLP pipeline extracts medication names, dosages, frequencies, and clinical warnings from uploaded prescription images — including handwritten doctor notes. Outputs a structured JSON report with drug interaction flags.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Vision + NLP dual pipeline</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Handwritten and printed Rx</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Dosage &amp; frequency extraction</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(158,50%,44%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Drug interaction flags</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l p-6 md:p-9\" style=\"border-color:rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\"><a id=\"feature-prescription-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap group-hover:shadow-md\" style=\"background:hsl(158,50%,44%);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px hsl(158,50%,44%)33\" href=\"/prescription\">Try module<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div id=\"feature-symptoms\" class=\"group relative rounded-2xl border overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.15);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-0\"><div class=\"p-7 md:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square h-5 w-5\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%)\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase rounded-full px-2 py-0.5\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%);background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\">Clinical NLP</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-1\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.3rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:hsl(var(--foreground))\">Symptom Checker</h2><p class=\"text-sm font-medium mb-3\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%)\">Natural language. Differential diagnosis. Specialist routing.</p><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-xl\">Describe symptoms in plain English. Our NLP triage engine generates a ranked differential diagnosis list with specialist routing recommendations, urgency triage, and follow-up question prompts — powered by a fine-tuned medical language model.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Medical NLP triage engine</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Differential diagnosis ranking</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Specialist routing logic</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" style=\"color:hsl(38,88%,54%)\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Urgency classification</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l p-6 md:p-9\" style=\"border-color:rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\"><a id=\"feature-symptoms-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap group-hover:shadow-md\" style=\"background:hsl(38,88%,54%);color:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px hsl(38,88%,54%)33\" href=\"/symptoms\">Try module<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-border bg-card/30\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-20\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\"><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-primary\" style=\"opacity:0\">Platform architecture</span><h2 class=\"font-bold mt-2 tracking-tight\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);letter-spacing:-0.025em;opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)\">Built for clinical trust</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-3 max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)\">Every architectural decision prioritises accuracy, explainability, and privacy — not engagement metrics.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-4\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-4.5 w-4.5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em\">Sub-3s inference</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">ONNX Runtime-optimised models quantised to INT8. Every module returns a result in under 3 seconds, even on commodity hardware.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-4\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-4.5 w-4.5 text-primary\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em\">Zero data retention</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Uploaded files are processed in memory and never written to disk. No user images are stored, logged, or used for retraining.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-4\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain h-4.5 w-4.5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em\">Research-grade datasets</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Every model is trained on peer-reviewed, publicly available clinical datasets. No synthetic data, no unlabelled scrapes.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-4\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target h-4.5 w-4.5 text-primary\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em\">Confidence-aware outputs</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">All predictions include calibrated probability scores. Low-confidence results trigger explicit clinical-review recommendations.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-4\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bar-chart3 h-4.5 w-4.5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em\">Explainable by default</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Grad-CAM saliency maps, SHAP charts, and per-feature attribution are included in every diagnostic report — not add-ons.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg mb-4\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch h-4.5 w-4.5 text-primary\"><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\" style=\"font-size:0.95rem;letter-spacing:-0.015em\">Structured PDF exports</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Every report exports as a structured PDF with findings, confidence scores, and recommended next steps formatted for clinical handoff.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-20\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_480px] gap-12 items-center\"><div><span class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-primary\">Under the hood</span><h2 class=\"font-bold mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);letter-spacing:-0.025em\">Production-grade stack,<br/><span class=\"font-serif font-normal italic text-muted-foreground\">not a weekend project.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-md\">MediVerse AI runs quantised ONNX models through a FastAPI inference server, with full Grad-CAM computation and SHAP explainability baked into each response — not bolted on afterward.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4 text-primary\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">HIPAA-aligned · End-to-end HTTPS · Zero data sharing</span></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 border-b border-border last:border-b-0\" style=\"background:transparent\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\"><rect width=\"16\" height=\"16\" x=\"4\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect width=\"6\" height=\"6\" x=\"9\" y=\"9\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M15 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M15 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 15h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 15h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M9 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 20v2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Model format</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground truncate\">ONNX Runtime (INT8 quantised)</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 border-b border-border last:border-b-0\" style=\"background:hsl(var(--muted) / 0.3)\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\"><path d=\"m12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83Z\"></path><path d=\"m22 17.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 17.65\"></path><path d=\"m22 12.65-9.17 4.16a2 2 0 0 1-1.66 0L2 12.65\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Inference backend</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground truncate\">Python FastAPI + ONNX RT</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 border-b border-border last:border-b-0\" style=\"background:transparent\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Training datasets</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground truncate\">NIH, MIT-BIH, HAM10000, PIMA</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 border-b border-border last:border-b-0\" style=\"background:hsl(var(--muted) / 0.3)\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Frontend</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground truncate\">Next.js 14 + Framer Motion</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 border-b border-border last:border-b-0\" style=\"background:transparent\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Security</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground truncate\">HTTPS / HIPAA-aligned / Zero retention</div></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-6 py-4 border-b border-border last:border-b-0\" style=\"background:hsl(var(--muted) / 0.3)\"><div class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md\" style=\"background:hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.1)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Uptime SLO</div><div class=\"text-sm font-medium text-foreground truncate\">99.9% (monitored)</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-border\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-20 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.97)\"><div class=\"inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl mb-6 mx-auto\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(196 88% 44%), hsl(196 92% 34%));box-shadow:0 4px 24px hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.3)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-6 w-6 text-white\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h2 class=\"font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight\" style=\"font-size:clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);letter-spacing:-0.025em\">Ready to run your first analysis?</h2><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto\">Free forever for personal screening. No card required. Your first result in under 60 seconds.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a id=\"features-bottom-cta\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-7 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:opacity-90 hover:shadow-lg\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(196 88% 44%), hsl(196 92% 34%));box-shadow:0 4px 20px hsl(196 88% 42% / 0.3)\" href=\"/signup\">Create free account<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card px-7 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-foreground transition-all hover:bg-accent\" href=\"/\">Back to home</a></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground/60 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3 w-3\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>No credit card · No waitlist · HIPAA-aligned</p></div></div></section><footer id=\"site-footer\" class=\"border-t border-border/60 surface-1 mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-[1160px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-14\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr_1fr_1fr] gap-10 mb-12\"><div class=\"col-span-2 md:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4 group\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-[8px] gradient-brand shadow-brand/30 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-3.5 w-3.5 text-white\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-bold text-[0.9rem] tracking-tight\">Medi<span class=\"text-gradient\">Verse</span></span></a><p class=\"text-[0.8rem] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-[180px]\">Clinical AI screening that respects your privacy and your time.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2 mt-5\"><a href=\"https://github.com/alokkumar2510\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"GitHub\" class=\"p-2 rounded-lg text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:bg-accent transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github h-3.5 w-3.5\"><path d=\"M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4\"></path><pa